entities.description:
{profile} draws one tile for every entity listed here. Each list both adds and removes: an entity you clear is deleted from the registry and does not come back with the same identity. {remaining} of {entity_limit} places are free.

Each label box is named after the element's stable ID, because that is what survives an entity being renamed in Home Assistant. Leave one empty to use the entity's own name. An entity added just now gets its label box the next time this page is opened.

{legend}

